**Ratfolk** (/' *ɹætfowk* /, Scripts) are a race of skinwalkers with a mix of human and ratlike features.

# Appearance

# Other Planes

# Powers and Abilities 

## Keen Smell
You have advantage on Perception checks that rely on smell.

## Pack Tactics
You have advantage on attack rolls against a creature if at least one of your allies is within 5 ft. of the creature, and the ally isn't incapacitated.
